      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Situated at the eastern tip of Montreal’s island, Anjou borders Rivière‑des‑Prairies–Pointe‑aux‑Trembles to the north and east.",
